// Missing is a fresh install; present-and-unreadable or present-and-not-UTF-8 is
// not empty. Read as "", it planned a fresh file and replaced the person's whole
// config.toml with AgentBar's two keys — with no backup worth having, since the
// backup reads the same bytes. The rule readConfigFile keeps for the JSON configs,
// and the one HookInstaller.installCodex keeps on macOS.
