}

// install-hooks, wire and unwire write into the agents' own configs, which
// AGENTBAR_HOME does not move: ~/.claude, ~/.codex and the rest are this HOME's. Run
// under a root of its own they would point the person's real agents at hooks under
// that root — a test sandbox, as often as not — and those hooks, started later by
// the agent, never see AGENTBAR_HOME, so they would report into ~/.agentbar from a
// copy that is deleted with the sandbox. Borrowing HOME moves both, consistently.
